mes from distance, in midfield. Referee Florian Badstuebner's low card record (-23%) and the derby boost (+39%) are both in the numbers; confirmed XIs were not out when I wrote this, so the view keeps the morning sizes.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-6,"call":"About 2.5 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.7 goals, already taking about 12% off Hamburg for Poulsen and 3% for Sambi Lokonga, and 4% off Werder for Weiser. Gruell, Werder's main creator (two goals, six assists), is not on the numbers' list and the Bundesliga's match-day predicted side again has Njinmah and Chuki instead, so I keep -6, about 2.5 goals; Fuellkrug's set pieces keep Werder dangerous even without him."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9.4 corners","text":"The numbers say 9.4 corners, most of them for Werder at home against Hamburg's back three with wing-backs. Losing Gruell and Weiser costs Werder some wide play, but Njinmah's pace and Dinkci on the flanks plus Werder's set-piece focus around Fuellkrug should still win corners, so nothing points clearly either way and I stay at 9.4."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 4.3 cards","text":"The numbers say 4.3 cards: they add 39% for the derby but take 23% off for referee Badstuebner, who shows only 3.1 cards a game, and both sides have been booked less than usual lately (all counted). The build-up is heated, with ex-Hamburg players facing whistles, but that is the normal derby feel the numbers already add, so I stay at 4.3."},"shots":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"About 29.9 shots","text":"The numbers say 31.1 shots, lifted by Werder's strong recent volume (+20%), including 21 shots at Stuttgart, much of it built through Gruell. With Gruell out and Weiser (counted for goals only) missing on the right, Werder lose two of their main suppliers, so I keep -4, about 29.9 shots."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-5,"call":"About 10.3 shots on target","text":"The numbers say 10.8 shots on target, with Werder's 43 on target in six games already added (+15%). Without Gruell, who set up many of those chances, Werder's openings should be fewer and less clean, while Hamburg get Daka and Muheim's long-range shooting back, which the numbers already expect, so I keep -5, about 10.3 shots on target."},"sources":["https://www.bundesliga.com/jp/bundesliga/matchday/2026-2027/10/sv-werder-bremen-vs-hamburger-sv/liveticker","https://www.90min.de/werder-blickt-schon-aufs-nordderby-hoffnung-bei-grull-sorgen-bei-dinkci","https://www.zdfheute.de/sport/fussball-bundesliga/werder-bremen-hamburger-sv-liveticker-bundesliga-highlights-saison-2026-27-100.html"],"written_at":"2026-11-22T16:10:11Z"},"league":"bundesliga","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-22T16:10:11Z","goals":{"home":1.606,"away":0.965,"total":2.571,"adjust_pct":-6.0,"sized":true,"lean":"lower","home_win":0.506,"draw":0.285,"away_win":0.209,"over":{"1.5":0.745,"2.5":0.474,"3.5":0.258},"over_show":{"0.5":0.906,"1.5":0.745,"2.5":0.474,"3.5":0.258,"4.5":0.118},"btts":0.513,"likely_scores":[{"score":"1-1","p":0.136},{"score":"1-0","p":0.105},{"score":"2-0","p":0.099},{"score":"2-1","p":0.095},{"score":"0-0","p":0.094}],"clean_sheet_home":0.381,"clean_sheet_away":0.201,"range":[1,5],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"0.5","p":0.906,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"4.5","p":0.882,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":5.629,"away":3.799,"total":9.428,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"8.5":0.584,"9.5":0.464,"10.5":0.351,"11.5":0.254},"over_show":{"7.5":0.702,"8.5":0.584,"9.5":0.464,"10.5":0.351,"11.5":0.254},"range":[5,14],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"6.5","p":0.806,"shown":false},"under":{"line":"12.5","p":0.825,"shown":false}}},"cards":{"home":2.277,"away":2.024,"total":4.301,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"3.5":0.605,"4.5":0.425,"5.5":0.272},"over_show":{"2.5":0.779,"3.5":0.605,"4.5":0.425,"5.5":0.272,"6.5":0.16},"range":[2,7],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"1.5","p":0.912,